        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2-5. An aggrieved employee shall institute action under the provisions hereof within fifteen (15) school days following the occurrence complained of. However, any aggrieved employee whose grievance deals with those items which are contained in the annual statement, shall have fifteen (15) months following receipt of said statement to file his-her grievance.",
