            "block_content": "2-5.2. Annual salary, step on guide, prior service pay, longevity pay, column on guide, extra compensation and number of sick leave days in accumulated sick leave bank as of September 1 next following the annual statement, and Hospital Plan in which the employee is enrolled.",
